eir productivity and provide  efficiency on their biggest costs which  is feeding so that's why we started on  building this officially feeder so this  is a machine to fit the fish  automatically that is connected to the  cloud and connected the sensor that can  sense the fish appetite so it can  improve the feed efficiency of the feed  conversion ratio as well as on  increasing the growth of the fish so  they can shorten the Harvest Cycles when  they use this kind of technology that is  a radically affordable they only need to  pay 10 per month to use this they will  see that their farming practices improve  because the technology is embedded in  their operations  foreign  is even more interesting because this  technology opening a new doors for us to  capture a lot of data information how  many feet that they're using what's the  feedback frequency per day what brand of  it that they're using and the farmers  can even capture more data information  on how many fish that they will be  harvesting how many fish are there  we try to use the data and build credit  scoring to connect Farmers with the  financial institution so they can  receive the financing from from  Financial intuition directly and we can  also use the data to connect Farmers to  the downstream buyers so in all in all  it's all about increasing the profit on  the farmers by leveraging the data and  Technology  foreign  each of the farmers has received many  benefits at least they productivity and  their income is increased from 40  percent to 200 with so many farmers that  started you know joining a fishery only  on like two ponds but right now they own  20 pounds so their productivity and  their income increased by 10 times only  joining officially in one year  it was really challenging it was not as  easy as I thought it would be because  when we had the product when I went to  the farmers the farmers never really  understood why they need to use this  product because most of the farmers are  very traditional and they've been doing  it for decades they've been feeding the  fish for 20 years and using traditional  model so they don't really know how this  helps and whether this replaced labor  and labor is very cheap in Indonesia but  when I asked them why they want to use  it fishery I thought it would be about  new technology and the solutions the  benefit of the product itself but  apparently not  what Farmers appreciate is about the  community that we need to build about  the sense of belongings on the bigger  mission that we have  so I think that's the biggest lesson  that building this is not just about the  numbers and the metrics but really about  the human side and human relationship  that we need to maintain to build and to  skill  so if I see visually contributing to  that larger ecosystem and and see if we  should play a role on you know feed more  people but also creating a livelihood  then also impacting that rural  communities so that's really what what  drives me what defines my definition of  success it's not about you know the  valuation and my own wealth but it's  really about how a visual can contribute  to General uh you know success of those  communities  we're currently doing a pilot outside  Indonesia we did a pilot in Vietnam we  were currently doing a pilot in India so  we would like to prove the solutions  that coming from Indonesian innovators  building in Indonesia Market can  actually take a big role in the global  aquaculture Market  we're really  excited about the future because we're  pioneering this sector we're technically  creating this category of of fish like  of aquaculture technology that then has  a really big upside on on building the  market and building the sector even  further and aquaculture is still  currently the fastest growing food  sector in the world so for us it's sky  is the limit  [Music]

